 McCain TV ads shown.  Map of campaign spending by the two presidential candidates shown.  [In Raleigh, OBAMA\u00a0- jokes about McCain's attacks.]  Tonight's joint campaign between Obama and former President Bill Clinton in Florida noted and their appearance in Florida discussed.  \n\n(Studio: Katie Couric, Jeff Greenfield)  The standings of Obama and McCain on the state level discussed using an electronic map to show electoral votes and what McCain has to do to pull out a win. ", "segment_duration": 410, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 909828, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Yk3dIV20nP", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-29", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 909827, "segment_id": "zh4UFhsikJ", "segment_broadcast_id": "Yk3dIV20nP", "segment_title": "Money Watch (Mortgages)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Katie Couric)  The Federal Reserve's cutting of interest rates and Stock Market Report reported.   (Studio: Anthony Mason)  The rise in mortgage rates examined; scenes shown from Washington of distressed homeowners marching on mortgage giant Fannie Mae.  [Homeowners Deborah CUMBO&#134;, Edna BARBER&#135;- protest.]  [Howard University Barron HARVEY&#134;- says the rate cut is a signal.]  [Assistant Secretary of Treasury Neel KASHKARI&#134;- comments.]  Tomorrow's GDP report previewed. ", "segment_duration": 120, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63460.0", "legacy_segment_id": 909829, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Yk3dIV20nP", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-29", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 909827, "segment_id": "18oT4Acg43", "segment_broadcast_id": "Yk3dIV20nP", "segment_title": "Airline Merger", "segment_description": "(Studio: Katie Couric)  The merger of Delta and Northwest airlines to become the world's largest carrier reported.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63580.0", "legacy_segment_id": 909830, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Yk3dIV20nP", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-29", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 909827, "segment_id": "sQSzbyKrJN", "segment_broadcast_id": "Yk3dIV20nP", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Katie Couric)", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63600.0", "legacy_segment_id": 909831, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Yk3dIV20nP", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-29", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 909827, "segment_id": "i0D1dQwshm", "segm